  "releaseNotes": "The scenarios of one fixture (Given(fixture), HttpTestBase.Given()) now share its OAuth2 token: a class of OAuth2 tests asks for one token instead of one per scenario. No code changes needed from 6.14.0. Upgrade guide: https://github.com/andrewBezerra/xunit-assured-net/blob/main/UPGRADING.md",
